*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Measurement intermediates. The per-frame sweep is a 22MB byproduct of
# measure_bridge_from_archives.py --frames-out; the cards summarised from it
# (bridge-frame-error.v1.json and friends) are what the policy cites, and both
# are reproducible from the archives. Committing the dump would put a large
# unreferenced file where a `git add docs/` would sweep it up.
docs/bridge-frames.*.json
# The same-side per-(clip, frame, side) stream: 111MB, reproducible, summarised into
# bridge-extreme-error.v1.json which is what the policy cites.
docs/bridge-sides.*.json
